  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "スマホロトムが　乗ってくれる棒。自撮りモードで　使うともう少し　遠くから　撮影できる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "스마트로토무가 올라탈 수 있는 봉. 셀프 카메라 모드일 때 사용하면 좀 더 멀리서 촬영할 수 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "能讓手機洛托姆搭上來的棒子。在自拍模式中使用，就能從更遠一點的地方拍攝。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une perche compatible avec les Motismart. Elle permet de se photographier d’un peu plus loin lorsqu’on prend des selfies.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Stab, an dem man sein Smart-Rotom befestigen kann, um Selfies von weiter weg zu machen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un palo en el que se puede montar el SmartRotom. Permite sacar fotos desde una distancia mayor en el modo selfi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Bastone su cui montare lo Smart Rotom. Permette di fare selfie da un po’ più lontano.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A stick to rest a Rotom Phone on. It allows you to take selfies from a little bit farther away than you could on your own.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "スマホロトムが　乗ってくれる棒。自撮りモードで　使うともう少し　遠くから　撮影できる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "可供手机洛托姆搭乘的棒子。在自拍模式中使用就能从稍远的地方拍照。",
